---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import config from "../../site.config";
import { disclaimer } from "@uaeprop/site-kit";
---
<Base title="Terms" description="What Property Desk is, what its numbers are and are not, and the limits of relying on them." path="/terms">
  <div class="col" style="padding-block: var(--space-l) var(--space-xl);">
    <h1>Terms</h1>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">We are not a broker</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">{disclaimer(config.brand)}</p>
    <p>
      Nothing here is an offer to sell property, an invitation to buy one, or an
      advertisement for any specific unit. We hold no Dubai Land Department
      advertising permit because there is nothing here to advertise.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">Arithmetic, not advice</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      The calculator applies published rates and customary market fees to a
      number you supply. It is not legal, financial or tax advice, it does not
      know your circumstances, and it cannot see the contract in front of you.
      Before committing, take advice from someone qualified who can.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">Figures go out of date</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      Fees, tariffs and lending practice all change, sometimes without notice.
      Every figure here carries the date it was last checked. Treat the output as
      indicative, and confirm it with the Land Department, your lender or your
      conveyancer before you rely on it. We do not warrant that any figure is
      current.
    </p>
    <p>
      Several of the amounts are negotiated rather than fixed, and are shown as a
      midpoint of the usual range. Your quote will differ, which is rather the
      point of knowing the range.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">Third-party names</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      Authorities, banks and developers are referred to descriptively, to explain
      how a transaction works. Those names belong to their owners, and reference
      does not imply affiliation or endorsement in either direction.
    </p>

    <h2 style="margin-top: var(--space-l);">Liability</h2>
    <p style="margin-top: var(--space-s);">
      This site is provided as it is. To the extent the law allows, we are not
      liable for loss arising from decisions taken on the basis of it. That is
      not an attempt to disclaim carelessness on our part: it is an
      acknowledgement that a calculator cannot know your transaction, and that
      the person who can is the one you should be paying.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
